    {
      "id": "q-exception",
      "kind": "open",
      "covers": "exceptions",
      "probeId": "P28",
      "onContradictionOnly": true,
      "prompt": "Both of those are things you have said, and neither of them is wrong. So what is the condition that tells them apart? Say it as the thing that has to be true for the second answer to be the right one."
